"P3079835114" "One of our Longbow communications officers has acquired some tactical intelligence on villain activities within the zone. Unfortunately, he has been kidnapped by Arachnos before he could deliver the intel to us! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Arachnos base, rescue our communications officer, and defeat the operatives responsible!</A><br><br>It's only a matter of time before Arachnos finds what our communications officer knows. You have 60 minutes to complete the mission!<br><br><color red>PvP Mission: This mission will bring you into direct conflict with villains.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3114241023" "Rescue officer, defeat all Arachnos"
// SendOffString :
"P1816690691" "If you rescue the communications officer, we'll be able to provide valuable information on villain activities to all the heroes in Bloody Bay!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1705066657" "The clock is ticking, {HeroName}! Rescue our communications officer!"

